Note on the dataset: the file data/ObesityDataSet_raw_and_data_sinthetic.csv
is third-party data originally published by Palechor, F. M., & de la Hoz
Manotas, A. (2019), "Dataset for estimation of obesity levels based on eating
habits and physical condition in individuals from Colombia, Peru and Mexico,"
Data in Brief, 25, 104344 (https://doi.org/10.1016/j.dib.2019.104344),
distributed under the terms of that publication (CC BY 4.0 per the
publisher's open-access license). The MIT License above applies to the code,
written text, figures, and other original content in this repository; it
does not alter the license terms of the redistributed dataset file.
